WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.790
- Do you feel like you're
a pretty good neighbor?

00:00:01.790 --> 00:00:04.320
Like 'cause I feel like neighbors used to,

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:06.370
well I'm telling you you're fun to watch.

00:00:07.637 --> 00:00:09.507
But I feel like when we were kids,

00:00:09.507 --> 00:00:11.160
you knew all your neighbors,

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:13.888
but like now people don't
really know all their neighbors.

00:00:13.888 --> 00:00:16.660
- So we moved into our
house during the pandemic,

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:17.493
which I think we talked about

00:00:17.493 --> 00:00:19.287
cause you saw my terrible garage.

00:00:19.287 --> 00:00:20.517
- Marie Kondo

00:00:20.517 --> 00:00:21.470
- Marie Kondo

00:00:21.470 --> 00:00:23.770
But now that we've sort
of gotten to know them,

00:00:23.770 --> 00:00:26.869
we actually also did this thing,
speaking of loving plants,

00:00:26.869 --> 00:00:31.400
we started 600 milkweed seeds
because we became obsessed

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:33.740
with saving the Monarch
butterflies and helping them.

00:00:33.740 --> 00:00:35.030
And so then we had this great idea,

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:36.730
like let's try to turn our neighborhood

00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:38.800
into like a Monarch sanctuary.

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:42.530
So we sowed all these milkweed
seeds and then we like potted

00:00:42.530 --> 00:00:45.010
them for everybody and put them
on our neighbor's door with

00:00:45.010 --> 00:00:46.600
like my husband likes to paint

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:48.260
so he did like a little butterfly.

00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:50.408
We had a lot of free time on our hands

00:00:50.408 --> 00:00:51.888
- But it's so adorable

00:00:51.888 --> 00:00:54.240
- And so now but it's so cool

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:56.920
when I'm slow jogging
through the neighborhood,

00:00:56.920 --> 00:01:00.310
there's Monarch butterflies everywhere.

00:01:00.310 --> 00:01:02.760
Like it really works. And
our neighbors loved it.

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:06.059
Like they genuinely-- cause
the first time it's like..

00:01:06.059 --> 00:01:06.892
- I'm going to plant some.

00:01:06.892 --> 00:01:09.156
- Yes. I should've brought
you some we still have some.

00:01:09.156 --> 00:01:10.180
- I have butterflies all over my backyard

00:01:10.180 --> 00:01:11.930
- Probably because you have
such good flowers and stuff.

00:01:11.930 --> 00:01:13.010
- We have flowers everywhere.

00:01:13.010 --> 00:01:15.280
- But the milkweed you'll
get the caterpillars

00:01:15.280 --> 00:01:16.113
in the chrysalis,

00:01:16.113 --> 00:01:17.660
which like for kids to watch, you know,

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:20.070
the butterflies grow
it's the coolest thing.

00:01:20.070 --> 00:01:22.520
- Yeah. My eldest is just
learning that in school.

00:01:22.520 --> 00:01:23.520
Like with science and stuff. Yeah.

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:25.440
It's really cool. But
every time you're here,

00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:27.120
we talk about your struggles with anxiety.

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:28.410
A lot of people struggle with anxiety,

00:01:28.410 --> 00:01:30.830
especially over the last two years.

00:01:30.830 --> 00:01:31.973
So how's that going?

00:01:33.074 --> 00:01:33.907
- Great.

00:01:33.907 --> 00:01:35.010
No, no, genuinely.

00:01:35.010 --> 00:01:35.843
- She's all like great...

00:01:35.843 --> 00:01:37.423
- Guys I'm perfect now.

00:01:38.310 --> 00:01:39.650
- Cause of my slow jog.

00:01:39.650 --> 00:01:41.500
- I slow jog and everything's better.

00:01:42.850 --> 00:01:43.683
It's actually going,

00:01:43.683 --> 00:01:45.440
I don't know if we've
talked about it before,

00:01:45.440 --> 00:01:47.680
but for years I've been doing
this meditation practice

00:01:47.680 --> 00:01:50.240
called yoga nidra, which sounds intense

00:01:50.240 --> 00:01:52.370
like you're doing asana like yoga poses,

00:01:52.370 --> 00:01:53.420
but you're actually not.

00:01:53.420 --> 00:01:56.740
It's the most like beginner
friendly meditation practice.

00:01:56.740 --> 00:02:00.630
You literally like lay
down in like a cozy Zen.

00:02:00.630 --> 00:02:04.860
Like you put a pillow
here and you can fall.

00:02:04.860 --> 00:02:07.230
You can fall asleep. Oh, it's the best.

00:02:07.230 --> 00:02:10.987
And like you get guided
through breath and through some

00:02:10.987 --> 00:02:12.610
visualizations and everything.

00:02:12.610 --> 00:02:16.644
And that has saved my life with
anxiety. I love it so much.

00:02:16.644 --> 00:02:18.510
- Everything is about breathing.

00:02:18.510 --> 00:02:21.210
- Yeah breathing and
coming out of your head

00:02:21.210 --> 00:02:22.509
and into your body.

00:02:22.509 --> 00:02:23.750
I loved it so much.

00:02:23.750 --> 00:02:26.930
I just got my teacher
training so that on my podcast

00:02:26.930 --> 00:02:29.540
I could lead people through yoga nidras,

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:32.020
and my first one is up and
you'll love this because it's

00:02:32.020 --> 00:02:34.711
inspired by Dolly Parton's
light of a clear blue morning

00:02:34.711 --> 00:02:38.010
because I got really
creative with meditations.

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:40.035
I'm really into like finding out how to

00:02:40.035 --> 00:02:42.950
infuse creativity and music into it.

00:02:42.950 --> 00:02:47.160
And so I love Dolly as we
all do. And so I wrote one

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:48.079
and it's up now.

00:02:48.079 --> 00:02:49.544
- And if you don't get out.

00:02:49.544 --> 00:02:51.000
- Yeah, it's on.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:51.900
- Yeah. If you don't,

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:54.670
